Written for the C/C++ lane of the graph-accuracy run (HANDOFF.md, OPEN product
defects, C/C++: `#line` after same-line comment not blanked,
preprocessor.cpp). The #define makes has_preprocessor_work true, so the file
takes cbm_preprocess_with_map's simplecpp path and without_line_directives
runs. The compiler honours both directives (the program prints "main at 951"
and "helper at 900"). The graph must report helper at line 11 and main at
line 14 of main.c, and the call main -> helper at line 16. Without the fix,
simplecpp's expansion carries `#line 900 "gen.y"` / `#line 950 "gen.y"`, and
build_line_map puts both functions in gen.y at 900+ instead of main.c.
